Game Name: "Evangelion: Angel Attack"

You can pick between 3 characters to unlock in the beginning: Shinji, Rei, Asuka

Gameplay: player picks an angel to fight, the fighting consists of player attacks
and from enemy attacks, each win is graded from F to S and you receive level points
based on performance, level points can be used to improve stats, purchase abilities,
unlock characters, unlock character skins, unlock ability slots

Player stats:

attack -> dictates damage
at field -> dictates defense
default sync rate -> sets default sync rate
  sync rate -> acts on damage, defense and accuracy
bond: acts mainly on accuracy and buffs sync rate
max health

Player attacks:

resync:

Evangelion unit's heart beats, player has to sync button presses with the audio.
raises sync rate by x%

multi-blow:

Minecraft fishing mechanic inspired: 1 area, spinner gets quicker, area gets smaller
and less time available.
deals x damage per blow

knife attack:

friday knight funkin mechanic
deals x damage times success percentage

precision strike:

reaction speed test: Evangelion unit scans enemy until weak spot appears, player 
then has to click
deals x damage affected by delay

Battle Mechanics:

angels have body parts/zones, the core is the weak zone, it's harder to destroy
but insta kills, otherwise, player needs to destroy all other body parts

berserk:

when sync rate is 100%, player can enter berserk mode, this combines multi-blow and
precision strike, and after, set at field to 100%, but, this then sets sync rate
down to 1% and self inflicts x damage

Enemy attacks:

bullet hell

laser beams on screen: lasers cover a part of the screen (horizontaly or veritcally)
and slides on its axis, disapears after x time

falling attack: Evangelion unit is running on a road with 3 lanes, enemy launches
obstacles on lanes, unit has to dodge by switching lanes

weeping angels: enemy drops pellets that go towards the player, but when the player 
looks at them, they freeze

minefield: the area gets littered with timed bombs

angel escape: angel grabs eva unit and you have to press the correct buttons when
they appear on screen to escape

Abilities (only allowed once per fight, except when specified):

Divine Intervention: When player gets to x% or less health, kaworu appears and 
for one round, player can't take damage

Miracle Sync: When player gets to x% or less sync rate, plays sync game: success
rate deals attack and regains x sync rate

Celestial Gift: summons spear of longinus and throws it at random body part, deals
x damage and doesn't miss

Ruthless: when enemy at x% or less health, attack gets raised significantly (always)

Counter: if player doesn't take damage from previous enemy attack, player's
attack deals x more damage points

Healing Mist: if player doesn't attack, like tony hawk freak out mechanic, and 
hp returns based on success (always)

Absolute Accuracy: Next attack doesn't miss (always)

Overclock: Attack stat goes to x% more but sets AT field to 0 and deals x self damage

Double or Nothing: your next attack does either double damage or misses

Eek! Run! : Skip your attack but the next 2 enemy attacks are easier to evade

Game Modes:

difficulties:

Easy: enemies deal less damage, it's easier to attack, gives less level points

Vanilla: normal difficulty

Hard: enemies deal more damage, it's hareder to attack, gives more level points

helpless: can't attack, enemies get an endurance bar, have to survive until bar gets
to zero, no abilities, gives a lot more level points

modes:

marathon: face up against every angel, one by one, no healing, lets player unlock any
ability

endless: face up against angels in random order, on by one until you die, plays
for highscore rather than points or anything

randomized: player faces up against a random angel, with random abilities and random attacks
and a random modifier

modifiers: increase enemy health by x%, increase enemy attack by x%, increase player attack
by x%, reduce player max health by x%, increase player max health by x%


pilot mastery: the player can achieve pilot mastery to unlock a master pilot cosmetic
requirements: beat all main angels in hard mode, unlock all ability slots (4), max out
stats, beat 1 angel in helpless mode

when the first main angels have been completed, the user unlocks harder variants of the angels


